  "goodToKnow": "Die Hierarchie is a hierarchy: eine strenge Hierarchie, flache Hierarchien (flat hierarchies, which many startups advertise). German workplaces are traditionally seen as quite hierarchical, with titles (Herr Doktor) and the formal Sie, though younger companies increasingly use du. Hierarchisch means hierarchical. From Greek hieros (holy) and archein (to rule). Plural: die Hierarchien."
